# Corroding Dragonstorm: "When this enchantment enters, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life. Surveil 2." and "When a
# Dragon you control enters, return this enchantment to its owner's hand." Bot1 casts it with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl: Bot2 is
# at 18, Bot1 at 22, and the surveil sees the Forest and the Island, keeping the Forest on top and binning the Island.
# An Ornithopter (not a Dragon) enters and the Enchantment stays (`?` check); Clarion Conqueror (a Dragon), cast with Black
# Lotus's {W}{W}{W}, returns it to the hand.

